         tints it, so only the shape matters). Unlike the adaptive icon there is no safe
         zone here, so the branch is scaled to fill the canvas — at 24dp the launcher's
         0.73 scale would leave it a barely visible speck.
         ★ Changing the geometry in ic_launcher_foreground means changing this too. -->
